{
  "name": "annie-player-svlx",
  "productName": "安妮播放器融合版",
  "version": "4.3.15",
  "changelog": {
    "4.3.15": "本地曲库排序增强：AM 歌曲视图新增排序下拉（首字母/文件名/修改时间/大小，正倒序），粒子舞台新增「修改时间 旧→新」，FB2K 新增「修改日期」列；修复收藏的导入歌单名统一显示为占位名（自动改回真名，旧条目打开详情自愈）；修复部分 WAV 中文标题乱码（GBK RIFF INFO 直读，旧缓存自动失效）；AutoEq 型号搜索升级：支持中文品牌名（森海/索尼/水月雨等）与无空格写法（HD650=HD 650）",
    "4.3.14": "修复 tx 在线音源播放错歌：部分聚合音源解析失败时退化为按歌名搜索返回同名不同曲，现对 QQ 流地址做曲目身份校验（strMediaMid/songmid），货不对板即拦截并自动尝试下一个音源，兜底走内置通道解析；搜索与播放均生效"
  },
  "description": "AnniePlayer SVLX - Annie Player integrated with lx-music-desktop (Apache-2.0). See THIRDPARTY/lx-music-desktop/NOTICE.LICENSE.",
  "main": "src/main.js",
  "author": "Annie Player Project",
  "license": "GPL-3.0-only",
  "private": true,
  "scripts": {
    "start": "electron .",
    "pack:dir": "electron-builder --dir --win",
    "dist": "electron-builder --win nsis --publish never",
    "dist:setup": "electron-builder --win nsis --x64 --publish never",
    "setup:tools": "node scripts/setup-tools.js",
    "smoke": "node scripts/smoke-test.js",
    "test:audio": "node scripts/audio-test.js",
    "test:soak": "node scripts/soak-test.js",
    "test:sandbox": "node scripts/sandbox-e2e-test.js",
    "test:lossless": "node scripts/lossless-test.js",
    "bench:library": "node scripts/library-bench.js",
    "gen:help": "node scripts/gen-readme-help.js",
    "release": "node scripts/release.js"
  },
  "dependencies": {
    "electron-updater": "^6.8.9",
    "iconv-lite": "^0.6.3",
    "music-metadata": "^11.14.0"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "electron": "^42.4.1",
    "electron-builder": "^26.15.3"
  },
  "build": {
    "appId": "com.annieplayer.svlx",
    "productName": "安妮播放器融合版",
    "publish": [
      {
        "provider": "github",
        "owner": "Zhou1019-1",
        "repo": "AnniePlayer-LXversion"
      }
    ],
    "copyright": "Copyright (c) Annie Player Project. Includes material from https://github.com/lyswhut/lx-music-desktop (Apache-2.0).",
    "compression": "maximum",
    "asarUnpack": [
      "**/*.node"
    ],
    "files": [
      "src/**/*",
      "annie/**/*",
      "package.json"
    ],
    "extraResources": [
      {
        "from": "engine/publish",
        "to": "engine",
        "filter": [
          "**/*",
          "!**/*.pdb"
        ]
      },
      {
        "from": "engine/tools",
        "to": "engine/tools",
        "filter": [
          "**/*"
        ]
      }
    ],
    "win": {
      "executableName": "AnniePlayerSVLX",
      "icon": "build/icon.ico",
      "target": [
        {
          "target": "nsis",
          "arch": [
            "x64"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    "directories": {
      "output": "setupEXE",
      "buildResources": "build"
    },
    "nsis": {
      "oneClick": false,
      "perMachine": false,
      "allowToChangeInstallationDirectory": true,
      "createDesktopShortcut": true,
      "createStartMenuShortcut": true,
      "shortcutName": "安妮播放器融合版",
      "runAfterFinish": false,
      "menuCategory": false,
      "artifactName": "annie-player-svlx-setup-${version}.${ext}"
    }
  }
}
